  "verseCount": 59,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "8",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JHN 8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "8",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu ena afuminepo aya ku lupili lwa Miolifa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabili lucelocelo abwelela kwi Tempele. Awe abantu balalongana umo ali. Elyo aikala atampa no kulabafunda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakafundisha bamafunde na Bafalise elyo baleta umwanakashi umo uo basangilishe mu lubembu. Bamwiminika na mu lwalala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baeba Yesu abati, “Kafundisha, uyu mwanakashi nabamusangilisha alecita ulubembu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.20.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Levi 20:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.22.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Amaf 22:24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu Mafunde, Mose atukonkomesha ukwipaya abanakashi ba uyu musango ku mabwe. Nga iwe, uletipo shani?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basosele ifi pakuti bakwate umwakumwikatila, eico balefwailisha imilandu. Lelo Yesu ainama atampa no kulemba panshi ku munwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cilya babikapofye ukumwipusha, Yesu ainuka, abeba ati, “Pali imwe bonse uushatala abifya, nabalilepo ukumulasa ilibwe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awe kabili ainama, alalemba panshi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bati bomfwe ifyo, balafumapo umo umo, abakalamba ebabalilepo. Yesu asuka ashalafye eka no mwanakashi, ninshi umwanakashi ashele eminine palya pene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo Yesu ainuka, alaipusha umwanakashi ati, “Mayo bushe bali kwi? Bushe kanshi tapali uwakukupeela umulandu?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao ayasuka ati, “Tapali nangu umo mukwai.” Yesu amweba ati, “Kanshi na ine nshilekupeela umulandu. Kabiye wikabwekeshapo ukubifya nakabili.”]",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8:11",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Muli ba Baibele bamo tamwaba ifikomo 7:53—8:11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
